</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d2e45bd2-e221-11f1-8e06-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26319581736584.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d2e45bd2-e221-11f1-8e06-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26319581736584.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ea83cf20-e221-11f1-afe7-e30bdda0333c</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:58:33 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d2e45bd2-e221-11f1-8e06-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26319581736584.jpg">© Efrem Lukatsky, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>A propos</category><title>Europe hunts for Palantir alternatives as militaries seek to limit US dependence</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/a-propos/20261116-europe-hunts-for-palantir-alternatives-as-militaries-seek-to-limit-us-dependence</link><description>
